{#- User-message template: wraps retrieved chunks in
    <context-NONCE>...</context-NONCE> followed by the question. The
    system prompt instructs the model to treat the block as untrusted
    data; the per-request nonce stops a malicious uploader from
    closing the block early via a literal `</context>` in their
    document (audit C5-HIGH-1, 2026-05-12).

    Vars:
      hits     — list of Hit objects with .source, .chunk_index, .content
      question — the (possibly rewritten) user question
      nonce    — random hex string, unique per request
-#}
{%- if not hits -%}
<context-{{ nonce }}>
(keine Treffer)
</context-{{ nonce }}>
{%- else -%}
<context-{{ nonce }}>
{% for h in hits -%}
[source: {{ h.source }} | chunk {{ h.chunk_index }}]
{{ h.content }}
{%- if not loop.last %}

---

{% endif %}
{%- endfor %}
</context-{{ nonce }}>
{%- endif %}

Frage: {{ question }}
